Forge Skills
Curated and maintained by Avichayil (qengine13).

This collection adapts the owner's source Plan Hygiene, Completion Hygiene, Project Forge,
Prompt Forge, Anti-Slop Gates, and Codex Crucible Forge packages, plus the Agent Memory runtime.
Anti-Slop Gates is derived from the owner's source skills collection and project quality gates.
The collection retains the Apache License 2.0 used by the source skills repository.

Public-edition changes: portable paths; shared subscription-aware model policy; documented
fallback review checklists; provider-neutral Crucible name; offline verdict validation and
aggregation replacing the machine-specific provider runner; public installation and examples.
Additional changes: isolated memory storage, explicit write/model controls, subscription CLI
adjudication, generic project conventions, and removal of private history from code and prose.
See docs/provenance.md for the boundaries of this edition.

Gauntlet Loop is NOT bundled. Its attribution credits Matt Shumer for the technique
and Jay E / RoboNuggets for packaging. The documentation links to that external project.
